@startuml Staging Omgeving - sequence diagram - synchroniseren 1.5
!theme reddress-lightorange

skinparam backgroundColor transparent
' skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true

title Synchroniseren Staging Omgeving

participant "Custom Application" as app
participant "File Server" as fs
participant "File Client" as fc

... <b>Downloaden File ...

autonumber 1.1
app -> fs: upload file
activate fs

fs --> app
deactivate fs

fc -> fs: download file
activate fs

fs --> fc
deactivate fs

... <b>Uploaden File ...

autonumber 1.1
fc -> fs: upload file
activate fs

fs --> fc
deactivate fs

app -> fs: download file
activate fs

fs --> app
deactivate fs

...
@enduml